<title>USA: Dayton Hudson to open Eden Prairie store.</title>
<headline>Dayton Hudson to open Eden Prairie store.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dayton Hudson Corp said Wednesday it plans to open a new Dayton's department store at the suburban Minneapolis Eden Prairie Center.</p>
<p>The store is scheduled to open in late summer, 1998 and will be Dayton's twenty-first location in the upper Midwest, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
